WEBVTT

00:23.057 --> 00:25.259
<i>--casualties have been medevacked.</i>

00:26.627 --> 00:27.995
<i>Live from Shibuya.</i>

00:28.062 --> 00:32.299
<i>I can see many cars ablaze
<i>at Shibuya Crossing.</i></i>

00:32.866 --> 00:35.169
<i>The destruction is like a war zone.</i>

00:35.903 --> 00:40.340
<i>--the area is closed off.
<i>The cause remains unknown.</i></i>

02:17.304 --> 02:18.305
Kurono!

02:20.741 --> 02:21.842
Your suit!

02:36.290 --> 02:37.157
Don't.

02:37.891 --> 02:39.259
Someone has to.

02:39.326 --> 02:40.694
But you can't!

02:42.963 --> 02:43.997
I have to!

02:44.831 --> 02:46.133
Who else will?

02:51.071 --> 02:52.239
Kurono!

03:23.971 --> 03:24.972
Kurono.

03:27.107 --> 03:28.408
How's Pop?

03:34.848 --> 03:35.849
He's alive!

03:38.418 --> 03:40.854
Good...

03:47.861 --> 03:50.864
Kurono? Please...

03:51.198 --> 03:54.401
Kurono! Kurono!

03:59.172 --> 04:01.475
No! I don't want to go!

04:01.541 --> 04:03.343
Kurono!

04:33.573 --> 04:36.176
<i>See my shiny and wavy hair.</i>

04:37.577 --> 04:39.346
<i>Enrich your hair.</i>

04:40.213 --> 04:42.916
NEWSFLASH
OSAKA IS IN A STATE OF EMERGENCY

04:42.983 --> 04:45.052
What's going on in Osaka?

04:45.419 --> 04:48.855
Maybe it's monsters, like in Shibuya?

04:51.124 --> 04:53.960
-OSAKA'S IN A STATE OF EMERGENCY.
-YOU OKAY?

04:54.027 --> 04:56.229
LIKE THE KILLINGS IN TOKYO.

04:58.131 --> 05:01.501
<i>It contains super rich
<i>hyaluronic acid, Akatsuki.</i></i>

05:01.568 --> 05:03.437
-IS IT THE U.S. MILITARY?
-IT'S MASSACRE!

05:15.115 --> 05:18.285
Ayumu, I'm in Shinjuku.
I'll catch a train.

05:19.519 --> 05:22.956
You're late. What have you been doing?

05:23.290 --> 05:24.458
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

05:25.559 --> 05:29.029
Do you remember what today is?

05:33.100 --> 05:34.067
What is it?

05:46.246 --> 05:47.581
He has a knife!

05:50.117 --> 05:51.017
Police!

05:55.956 --> 05:56.890
There!

06:04.965 --> 06:06.299
Where are you hurt?

06:07.901 --> 06:09.169
You'll be okay.

06:37.030 --> 06:38.698
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, AYUMU

07:01.354 --> 07:03.723
Am I alive?

07:15.502 --> 07:16.536
Hey, you--

07:19.372 --> 07:21.608
Are you in shock?

07:24.344 --> 07:25.278
I got...

07:26.480 --> 07:27.414
stabbed.

07:28.648 --> 07:29.549
You were?

07:34.321 --> 07:37.123
I dropped dead from a stroke.

07:37.724 --> 07:41.228
Reika here was in a car accident.

07:44.698 --> 07:45.599
<i>Reika...</i>

07:46.666 --> 07:47.634
The star?

07:48.134 --> 07:51.204
Oh, yeah. She's a big deal, right?

07:51.605 --> 07:55.075
I'm a bit out of touch,

07:55.442 --> 07:58.111
but I saw her in a TV ad.

07:58.545 --> 08:00.614
What was it? Shampoo...

08:00.680 --> 08:02.782
Oh, please. Who cares?

08:05.385 --> 08:08.555
Aren't you her fan, Nishi?

08:09.189 --> 08:10.624
I know you schoolboys...

08:10.690 --> 08:12.192
Shut up, Baldy.

08:17.130 --> 08:19.232
What's your name?

08:22.802 --> 08:24.604
Masaru Kato.

08:25.739 --> 08:28.575
My name is Suzuki.

08:29.209 --> 08:31.077
Nice to meet you.

08:31.144 --> 08:32.812
What's going on?

08:33.647 --> 08:35.115
Explain!

08:38.051 --> 08:39.753
It's hard to believe,

08:40.453 --> 08:44.291
but we all died before.

08:44.791 --> 08:46.059
What...?

08:46.126 --> 08:48.161
You told me the same thing.

08:48.595 --> 08:51.097
It makes no sense to me!

08:51.765 --> 08:55.769
<i>Rise and shine
<i>It's a new morning for us</i></i>

08:55.835 --> 08:59.739
<i>A morning of new hope</i>

09:00.140 --> 09:04.110
<i>Breathe in
<i>A chest full of joy</i></i>

09:04.177 --> 09:08.081
<i>Look up at the clear, blue sky!</i>

09:08.148 --> 09:10.517
<i>Listen to the radio</i>

09:10.584 --> 09:12.085
What's this?

09:12.352 --> 09:16.323
<i>The summer breeze
<i>It is so wholesome</i></i>

09:16.389 --> 09:20.460
<i>Breathe in and exercise now</i>

09:20.527 --> 09:23.763
<i>To the count of one, two and three</i>

09:26.733 --> 09:30.170
<i>Your old lives have ended.</i>

09:33.873 --> 09:39.479
<i>I will decide how to use your new lives.
<i>That's the way the cookie crumbles.</i></i>

09:41.548 --> 09:45.652
<i>Go now and finish off this guy.</i>

09:46.219 --> 09:48.221
<i>Nurarihyon.</i>

09:51.424 --> 09:53.893
HE KICKS ASS. HE WON'T GIVE UP.
KILL HIM IN GIVEN TIME.

09:54.160 --> 09:57.464
Oh, no. He looks tough!

09:58.264 --> 10:00.233
What is this thing?

10:01.468 --> 10:04.437
This black orb is... Gantz.

10:05.639 --> 10:06.573
Gantz?

10:07.273 --> 10:11.344
I don't know why,
but that's what everyone calls it.

10:16.182 --> 10:17.417
What the hell?

10:18.551 --> 10:20.553
Are these toy guns?

10:21.888 --> 10:24.858
"Kato-cha, LOL." Is this mine?

10:26.526 --> 10:31.598
You two first-timers
had better get dressed now.

10:31.665 --> 10:35.735
Don't tell me what to do, Baldy!

10:44.878 --> 10:48.281
Morons like him always die first.

10:49.349 --> 10:52.318
What's that, punk?

10:52.585 --> 10:54.888
You're just a stupid gamer.

10:56.189 --> 10:59.292
You have an attitude, school kid.

11:02.328 --> 11:04.964
I'm talking to you, punk!

11:05.865 --> 11:07.500
-Nishi!
-Don't!

11:22.348 --> 11:23.516
I told you.

11:23.583 --> 11:24.517
Nishi!

11:24.884 --> 11:27.487
He would have only dragged us down.

11:33.560 --> 11:35.628
This guy looks useless, too.

11:35.862 --> 11:36.830
Are you okay?

11:37.497 --> 11:39.599
Put on the gear, Kato!

11:40.567 --> 11:41.734
Who are you?

11:43.636 --> 11:48.007
We're stuck playing
an endless survival game.

11:48.741 --> 11:50.443
A survival game?

11:50.510 --> 11:53.880
You must have seen it on the news.

11:54.414 --> 11:57.350
You know the monster in Shibuya...?

11:57.784 --> 11:59.886
We fight the monsters.

12:00.453 --> 12:05.291
You mean,
you're the ones in the black suits?

12:06.626 --> 12:07.994
In the previous game,

12:08.695 --> 12:13.566
our toughest members
were eliminated unfortunately.

12:14.767 --> 12:16.436
We lost our leader.

12:18.771 --> 12:21.441
Gantz, beam me out of here.

12:25.712 --> 12:27.313
Hurry up, Kato!

12:34.521 --> 12:36.656
Quickly, please!

12:43.429 --> 12:45.398
Put it on!

13:35.481 --> 13:36.749
Are you okay?

13:42.622 --> 13:44.691
Wait a minute...

13:45.592 --> 13:46.659
DOTONBORI

13:46.726 --> 13:47.627
We're...

13:49.429 --> 13:50.630
This is Osaka!

13:51.898 --> 13:55.535
But we're always sent to Tokyo!

14:36.075 --> 14:38.978
She's out of range, moron.

15:02.168 --> 15:03.703
Are you okay?

15:05.071 --> 15:07.106
You guys are useless.

15:09.042 --> 15:12.078
Sorry, I totally panicked.

15:12.145 --> 15:14.113
What's going on?

15:14.948 --> 15:16.883
Explain it to me.

15:16.950 --> 15:18.217
Fuck off.

15:18.484 --> 15:21.020
What's going on? What is she?

15:21.654 --> 15:23.723
-Why us?
-Wait, Nishi!

15:24.123 --> 15:25.959
I'll tell him.

15:34.667 --> 15:36.936
Why do we have to fight them?

15:37.603 --> 15:39.172
And who are they?

15:39.872 --> 15:41.708
We don't know.

15:43.142 --> 15:44.477
We only know one thing.

15:44.777 --> 15:49.682
We have to kill all the enemies
before our time runs out.

15:51.017 --> 15:52.986
What if we don't?

15:55.088 --> 15:55.955
Then...

15:59.926 --> 16:02.061
We'd all die.

16:02.128 --> 16:03.262
But...

16:04.697 --> 16:05.932
For real.

16:07.667 --> 16:10.636
We'd no longer exist in the world.

16:12.171 --> 16:13.940
That's the Gantz rules.

16:14.841 --> 16:17.110
What do you mean, rules?

16:20.613 --> 16:21.514
Oh, no!

16:22.682 --> 16:24.083
Impossible!

16:44.971 --> 16:46.005
Come here.

17:21.874 --> 17:22.942
This way.

18:09.188 --> 18:11.190
Kato, go ahead and shoot!

18:22.768 --> 18:23.903
Kato!

18:38.351 --> 18:39.318
I'm okay?

18:40.319 --> 18:42.788
The suit protected you. Come on!

18:52.965 --> 18:54.200
Who did it?

18:56.702 --> 18:59.272
-He's lying!
-Are you?

19:18.257 --> 19:19.926
Who are they?

19:20.459 --> 19:23.896
You have a Tokyo accent.

19:24.397 --> 19:27.166
Are you the Osaka team?

19:27.233 --> 19:28.768
Osaka team?

19:29.268 --> 19:31.003
So, there are more?

19:31.771 --> 19:34.207
How come you don't know that?

19:34.907 --> 19:37.410
This is his first game.

19:40.146 --> 19:44.083
A novice, a kid, a middle-aged man,
and a woman.

19:44.150 --> 19:46.085
How pathetic.

19:52.491 --> 19:53.759
Ouch!

19:53.826 --> 19:55.962
Is he okay?

19:56.462 --> 20:00.433
As long as you're still alive,
you'll get back all your limbs

20:00.933 --> 20:04.036
when the stage is cleared.

20:04.470 --> 20:05.771
What...?

20:05.838 --> 20:10.142
How about that tough guy
who's called Kuro or something?

20:10.209 --> 20:11.510
He's dead.

20:13.179 --> 20:15.348
Wait a minute!

20:16.349 --> 20:17.383
It's Reika!

20:17.450 --> 20:20.486
Man! Look at the jugs on her!

20:20.753 --> 20:21.454
Shit!

20:25.992 --> 20:28.194
Hey, the Tokyo team's not bad.

20:31.097 --> 20:32.398
More of them!

20:32.465 --> 20:34.133
Here we go!

20:42.942 --> 20:45.378
You just sit and watch, wimps.

20:52.051 --> 20:55.855
Reika, watch us finish them off.

20:56.122 --> 20:58.324
Then we can swap numbers.

20:58.557 --> 21:01.193
Come on, George!

21:04.830 --> 21:07.166
There are so many of them!

21:07.466 --> 21:09.935
I'll go for the right side.

21:10.169 --> 21:11.937
How about you?

22:16.335 --> 22:18.904
They're enjoying this...

22:29.348 --> 22:32.985
That's worth points. I'll have it.

23:02.615 --> 23:05.451
How about that, Reika?

23:10.389 --> 23:13.159
The Osaka team is tough.

23:13.559 --> 23:16.996
What's that weapon and the bike thing?

23:19.665 --> 23:24.570
You can get superior weapons
if you score 100 points.

23:25.104 --> 23:26.305
One hundred points...?

23:27.206 --> 23:29.074
<i>After defeating the enemies,</i>

23:29.542 --> 23:33.579
<i>we're teleported back to the room
<i>to get scored.</i></i>

23:34.380 --> 23:36.282
100-POINT MENU

23:36.348 --> 23:38.984
<i>If you get 100, you win the game.</i>

23:42.421 --> 23:46.525
Gantz gives you three bonus options.

23:46.592 --> 23:48.060
<i>Like what?</i>

23:49.695 --> 23:51.730
<i>Like superior weapons.</i>

23:52.264 --> 23:54.967
<i>Or resurrect a dead teammate.</i>

23:55.034 --> 23:57.436
<i>You can bring them back?</i>

23:57.970 --> 24:01.106
<i>Apparently. I've never done it.</i>

24:01.173 --> 24:02.374
<i>And the third option?</i>

24:03.175 --> 24:04.310
3. HAVE YOUR MEMORY WIPED AND QUIT.

24:04.376 --> 24:05.377
<i>Graduation.</i>

24:06.512 --> 24:08.113
<i>You'll be free!</i>

24:08.180 --> 24:09.215
Free?

24:10.216 --> 24:13.652
Score 100 points
and you can leave this all behind.

24:14.119 --> 24:19.191
You'll forget all about the Gantz games
and go back to your regular life.

24:21.126 --> 24:23.529
Anyway, it's good, isn't it?

24:24.196 --> 24:27.099
We won't have to do anything.

24:27.566 --> 24:30.569
The Osaka guys will wipe out the monsters.

24:31.070 --> 24:36.475
I'll let them have the small ones,
and I'll take the Boss at the end.

24:40.012 --> 24:45.351
Nishi's strategy is to hide and wait
for the strongest one at the end.

24:45.718 --> 24:49.355
Killing the Boss scores you
a lot of points.

24:50.456 --> 24:51.423
Help!

25:00.065 --> 25:02.268
We have to help those people.

25:03.035 --> 25:04.236
Come on, Suzuki.

25:05.437 --> 25:08.307
We should avoid any unnecessary risks.

25:08.374 --> 25:09.341
Suzuki!

25:11.043 --> 25:13.345
-But isn't that what you do?
-Well...

25:13.412 --> 25:15.214
Not without our leader...

25:15.481 --> 25:16.582
Come on!

25:20.152 --> 25:23.088
We're not tough enough
to protect other people.

25:37.202 --> 25:41.540
We can leave it to the Osaka team...

25:42.441 --> 25:46.412
so that we can just concentrate
on surviving, okay?

25:47.579 --> 25:50.582
Kato, wait! Kato!

25:55.354 --> 25:58.590
If you must go, keep this.

26:02.094 --> 26:04.296
Someone's waiting for your call.

26:04.663 --> 26:08.367
There are still some pay phones around.

26:13.572 --> 26:17.509
Make sure that you don't die.

26:48.307 --> 26:49.508
It's good.

26:51.310 --> 26:53.178
All the sauce we want!

27:02.454 --> 27:05.224
Do you see that there?

27:09.228 --> 27:10.295
Yeah...

27:11.830 --> 27:13.632
It's no Biriken statue.

27:21.540 --> 27:23.342
He's spooky.

27:37.222 --> 27:38.690
<i>The Kato residence.</i>

27:40.926 --> 27:42.227
<i>Hello?</i>

27:44.263 --> 27:46.398
Ayumu, it's me.

27:47.666 --> 27:50.836
Where have you been?
I've been calling you.

27:51.870 --> 27:52.871
Sorry.

27:53.939 --> 27:55.774
I was called into work.

27:56.542 --> 27:58.811
On a night like this?

27:59.445 --> 28:01.780
With what's happening in Osaka?

28:05.517 --> 28:07.319
What's happening there?

28:08.220 --> 28:11.223
Some monsters are running wild in Osaka.

28:12.825 --> 28:14.226
Really?

28:15.394 --> 28:16.628
I had no idea.

28:17.796 --> 28:21.567
<i>How is that even possible?
<i>Anyway, just come home.</i></i>

28:23.268 --> 28:24.269
Sorry.

28:25.471 --> 28:26.805
It'll be a while.

28:28.574 --> 28:31.643
Okay, see you later.

28:31.710 --> 28:32.644
<i>Ayumu.</i>

28:34.279 --> 28:35.314
<i>What?</i>

28:38.784 --> 28:40.419
I will come home.

28:42.020 --> 28:45.624
I know that!
I'll eat first, then go to bed.

29:03.909 --> 29:04.810
It's here!

29:18.924 --> 29:19.925
Damn it!

30:31.096 --> 30:32.598
Hi there!

30:36.702 --> 30:38.804
You with the Tokyo team?

30:40.672 --> 30:41.740
Right.

30:42.541 --> 30:46.545
I'm Anzu Yamasaki,
from the Osaka team. And you?

30:48.947 --> 30:50.682
I'm Masaru Kato.

30:51.650 --> 30:54.620
How old are you? I'm 23.

30:55.754 --> 30:56.855
Seventeen.

30:57.489 --> 31:00.893
A high-school boy! You're just a kid.

31:04.463 --> 31:06.598
I've been watching you.

31:07.833 --> 31:10.869
I got really curious about...

31:11.436 --> 31:13.672
what you were doing.

31:15.540 --> 31:18.076
I'm sure I'm wrong, but...

31:18.877 --> 31:22.047
Did you just save that family?

31:24.182 --> 31:26.551
What were you really doing?

31:27.452 --> 31:28.453
Well...

31:29.621 --> 31:31.156
I saved the family.

31:31.423 --> 31:34.593
Oh, my God, it's impossible!

31:34.660 --> 31:35.627
I did.

31:35.694 --> 31:37.829
No! No one does that.

31:38.196 --> 31:39.498
But I did!

31:40.165 --> 31:43.902
Would you just watch someone get killed?

31:46.838 --> 31:48.073
Phony Alien!

31:53.512 --> 31:55.180
Are you upset?

31:55.948 --> 31:57.215
I'll help people.

31:58.083 --> 31:59.685
Quit it.

32:00.452 --> 32:02.220
You hypocrite.

32:03.155 --> 32:04.690
Don't follow me.

32:05.590 --> 32:09.795
Lighten up. I love watching weirdos.

32:12.631 --> 32:14.132
You're funny.

32:15.701 --> 32:19.137
I know you won't last long.

32:22.841 --> 32:24.109
I just remembered.

32:25.010 --> 32:28.647
I saw a kid hiding with some old people.

32:29.147 --> 32:31.116
I hope they're okay.

32:31.183 --> 32:32.784
Where are they?

32:34.786 --> 32:36.688
You're such a show-off!

32:40.058 --> 32:44.563
Don't cry or the monsters will get us.

32:44.896 --> 32:48.000
We're finished. It's just like hell.

32:48.600 --> 32:50.969
It's okay if I die...

32:51.036 --> 32:54.072
but not the boy.

32:54.573 --> 32:56.942
His life's just begun.

32:57.009 --> 32:59.611
I want to take him to his parents.

33:02.948 --> 33:05.283
Get away from it!

33:05.851 --> 33:08.754
You run! I'll take care of it!

33:08.820 --> 33:10.088
Honey!

33:20.699 --> 33:22.134
Honey!

33:27.039 --> 33:27.973
Honey!

33:35.714 --> 33:36.581
There they are.

33:38.116 --> 33:40.552
Are you okay? I'll save you!

33:41.186 --> 33:42.587
Back away!

33:46.191 --> 33:47.192
Run!

33:47.692 --> 33:49.728
No. I'll save them!

33:49.795 --> 33:52.731
No way. You can't beat him!

33:56.802 --> 33:57.869
I'll save them.

33:58.603 --> 34:00.038
Don't you dare!

34:01.339 --> 34:03.275
I know you're scared.

34:05.143 --> 34:07.345
You'll die, you blockhead!

34:10.148 --> 34:13.819
Stop! He'll seriously kill you!

34:14.152 --> 34:15.253
You idiot!

34:19.624 --> 34:21.960
He can die if he wants to.

34:22.027 --> 34:25.130
He's just a hopeless moron...

34:26.832 --> 34:30.602
He is kind of cute though.

34:32.671 --> 34:35.073
Is there anything I can do, boy?

34:35.640 --> 34:36.775
Just move away.

34:37.676 --> 34:39.744
Idiots like that are rare.

34:41.046 --> 34:42.714
One of a kind...

34:51.389 --> 34:52.924
Get back!

34:55.026 --> 34:56.194
What's this?

34:59.698 --> 35:02.234
Maybe I'm scared...

35:04.736 --> 35:06.304
...to see him die.

35:28.126 --> 35:29.294
How can I beat him?

35:33.365 --> 35:35.167
What an idiot!

35:46.077 --> 35:47.078
Damn it!

36:20.178 --> 36:21.079
Excuse me!

37:00.418 --> 37:01.753
Now what?

37:31.149 --> 37:32.150
Hey!

37:36.955 --> 37:37.989
Are you okay?

37:41.493 --> 37:43.528
Hey, are you okay?

38:02.347 --> 38:05.216
Is there a doctor or a paramedic?

38:06.951 --> 38:09.921
Someone call an ambulance!

38:11.956 --> 38:16.027
<i>Major roads are swarming with citizens.</i>

38:16.594 --> 38:21.333
<i>Experts say that the creatures
<i>are not of this Earth</i></i>

38:21.399 --> 38:23.902
<i>but of alien origin.</i>

38:24.269 --> 38:26.237
You're gonna save more people?

38:30.075 --> 38:31.042
Yeah.

38:32.877 --> 38:37.115
Why are you acting like such a hero?

38:38.550 --> 38:39.951
Leave it alone.

38:40.585 --> 38:46.124
I'm just curious about your upbringing.

38:48.226 --> 38:51.062
What do your parents do?

38:52.564 --> 38:53.598
My parents?

38:55.600 --> 38:57.502
Dad was a firefighter.

38:58.303 --> 39:01.072
He died with Mom in a car accident.

39:01.973 --> 39:04.509
When I was in junior high.

39:08.012 --> 39:09.147
Any siblings?

39:10.148 --> 39:11.883
A brother, 10.

39:12.250 --> 39:14.586
Is he in an orphanage?

39:15.553 --> 39:19.023
I work so we can live in an apartment.

39:20.492 --> 39:24.963
If you don't survive,
your brother would be left alone.

39:26.364 --> 39:27.332
Right.

39:28.233 --> 39:31.503
I live with my 3-year-old son.

39:32.270 --> 39:34.038
You're a mom?

39:35.240 --> 39:37.542
Yeah. Do I look too young?

39:40.545 --> 39:45.083
Hey! Just say "yes"
whenever you're asked that.

39:50.688 --> 39:54.325
Anyway, we're both in a similar situation.

39:56.227 --> 39:58.096
We can't afford to die.

39:58.663 --> 39:59.697
Never.

40:02.400 --> 40:03.435
Right.

40:05.003 --> 40:06.337
We can't die.

40:10.308 --> 40:14.245
<i>Military personnel have been deployed</i>

40:14.446 --> 40:17.048
<i>all across the city.</i>

40:18.683 --> 40:22.654
<i>We have an update on the mysterious people
<i>in black suits.</i></i>

40:23.655 --> 40:27.225
<i>This footage was just uploaded
<i>to a video site.</i></i>

40:28.259 --> 40:33.565
<i>A young man in black fought
<i>to protect an old couple and a child.</i></i>

40:39.137 --> 40:40.972
THEY EXIST!

40:41.039 --> 40:43.208
-I'M IMPRESSED.
-GO, OSAKA!

40:43.274 --> 40:45.610
-SEE THE NEWS?
-IS IT REAL?

40:45.677 --> 40:48.379
-THE TV SAYS SO.
-GO, BLACK SUIT!

40:56.087 --> 40:57.222
Go now!

40:57.288 --> 40:58.490
Thank you.

41:09.167 --> 41:11.436
-Use the big gun!
-Not yet!

41:11.503 --> 41:13.171
I'll do it.

41:14.205 --> 41:17.375
There's something crazy about them...

41:22.046 --> 41:24.315
Guys like them always survive.

41:25.717 --> 41:27.352
That dark-skinned one...

41:27.619 --> 41:29.521
We call him George.

41:30.321 --> 41:32.490
His real name is Shimaki.

41:33.391 --> 41:34.759
He's won three bonuses.

41:37.328 --> 41:39.364
The tall skinhead is Nobuo Muroya.

41:40.164 --> 41:42.066
We call him Nobuyan.

41:42.767 --> 41:44.302
He's won four times.

41:45.336 --> 41:47.372
He's a megalomaniac.

41:47.772 --> 41:49.073
And he's a reckless...

41:50.508 --> 41:52.110
self-appointed leader.

41:52.810 --> 41:53.678
But...

41:54.812 --> 41:56.514
there's one more.

41:57.749 --> 41:59.117
Really?

42:00.451 --> 42:04.088
Hachiro Oka, a seven-time bonus winner.

42:05.523 --> 42:07.225
He's somewhere.

42:09.093 --> 42:11.262
He cloaks himself and goes into hiding.

42:22.574 --> 42:25.143
<i>Good...</i>

42:38.489 --> 42:40.725
I hope Kato is doing okay.

42:45.129 --> 42:46.164
What's wrong?

42:48.499 --> 42:50.234
If Kurono was alive,

42:50.735 --> 42:54.572
would he have saved people like Kato?

42:55.673 --> 42:59.143
I'm sure he would have.

43:00.578 --> 43:04.415
We can resurrect Kurono if we score 100.

43:05.583 --> 43:08.586
We don't have a chance.

43:09.721 --> 43:11.356
But, Suzuki...

43:11.422 --> 43:15.393
We can hardly take care of ourselves.

43:19.631 --> 43:20.698
Oh, no!

44:14.752 --> 44:17.188
There's one in Japan?

44:21.392 --> 44:23.561
Is it on our side?

44:49.454 --> 44:52.390
The Boss creature should be 100 points.

44:52.924 --> 44:55.960
One hundred points for one creature?

44:56.360 --> 44:58.329
Yeah, 100 for one.

44:58.729 --> 45:03.501
The monsters on the tower look badass.

45:04.402 --> 45:07.438
Killing one won't get 100 points.

45:07.505 --> 45:10.942
Oka says it's happened before.

45:11.008 --> 45:12.276
Really?

45:13.244 --> 45:17.248
It was before our time.
Before we went to the room.

45:18.316 --> 45:20.651
Everyone died except Oka.

45:21.385 --> 45:23.554
Oka killed the Boss monster.

45:23.955 --> 45:25.256
By himself!

45:26.424 --> 45:28.326
He's a monster himself!

45:46.277 --> 45:47.011
Oh, God.

45:48.279 --> 45:49.380
What's that?

45:50.381 --> 45:53.618
It's way out of our league.

45:53.684 --> 45:55.920
Freeze! Put your hands up!

45:58.055 --> 45:59.323
Wait!

46:00.925 --> 46:01.792
Don't shoot!

46:05.363 --> 46:06.497
Kato!

46:06.898 --> 46:07.832
Don't shoot!

46:08.599 --> 46:11.736
You in the black suits! Who are you with?

46:12.036 --> 46:13.638
-I'll shoot!
-Wait!

46:14.539 --> 46:18.376
-We're agents.
-State your unit.

46:18.843 --> 46:19.944
Our unit is...

46:20.678 --> 46:21.679
Gantz.

46:23.381 --> 46:24.515
Gantz?

46:27.818 --> 46:29.954
He's in even more trouble!

46:30.454 --> 46:32.490
-Show your ID!
-We don't have any.

46:32.790 --> 46:34.058
But it's true!

46:34.325 --> 46:35.593
-I'll shoot!
-No!

46:36.060 --> 46:37.094
Wait a minute.

46:58.416 --> 46:59.650
Fire!

47:03.788 --> 47:05.690
Run, all of you!

47:22.540 --> 47:23.641
Watch Suzuki!

47:47.598 --> 47:48.799
Come and get me!

48:31.108 --> 48:32.143
No way.

48:53.030 --> 48:54.098
Well?

48:56.734 --> 48:57.735
Hey.

48:58.602 --> 49:00.738
You're shitting me.

49:06.944 --> 49:08.579
It's not dead.

49:09.680 --> 49:11.082
Is it a 100?

49:11.982 --> 49:13.250
I'll do him.

49:17.722 --> 49:21.192
You'll be flatter than paper
when I'm through.

49:34.672 --> 49:37.575
Pretty tough, aren't you?

49:37.641 --> 49:38.943
You cockroach.

50:03.801 --> 50:05.236
Stop playing!

50:08.038 --> 50:09.840
You fuck!

50:19.717 --> 50:22.887
You goddamn motherfucker!

50:25.122 --> 50:26.857
Fucking help!

50:26.924 --> 50:31.128
Boo-hoo, can't you take care of yourself?

50:48.345 --> 50:52.283
I bet you shit your pants, Muroya.

51:03.727 --> 51:05.196
Fuck...

51:07.932 --> 51:09.066
He's dead.

51:10.301 --> 51:11.268
No way!

51:26.717 --> 51:28.352
So, you're their boss?

51:29.220 --> 51:30.921
That old man?

51:39.630 --> 51:41.332
Gotcha!

51:59.950 --> 52:01.118
What the...?

52:02.753 --> 52:04.889
What is this?

52:05.956 --> 52:07.858
What is it?

52:52.403 --> 52:54.738
I've caught you!

53:17.928 --> 53:20.130
This can't be true!

53:20.998 --> 53:22.399
They're both dead!

53:27.004 --> 53:28.205
What's your plan?

53:30.341 --> 53:33.077
I'll do whatever I can.

53:33.477 --> 53:35.112
You'll die!

53:35.379 --> 53:37.414
Think of your brother!

53:37.481 --> 53:40.117
That's why it has to be done.

53:41.518 --> 53:43.153
Otherwise...

53:44.021 --> 53:45.456
we'll all die.

53:48.359 --> 53:49.994
But how?

53:50.761 --> 53:54.298
Hey! Hey! Don't be stupid!

54:31.168 --> 54:32.336
She just dodges it!

54:43.047 --> 54:44.448
She's too quick.

54:46.216 --> 54:47.384
All together!

55:12.142 --> 55:13.177
She was hit.

55:25.889 --> 55:28.225
A hit to the head has no effect!

55:32.429 --> 55:33.497
Cover me.

55:39.169 --> 55:42.239
<i>Ayumu, I promise you.</i>

55:43.574 --> 55:45.375
<i>I'll come home!</i>

56:37.194 --> 56:38.962
I got the Boss!

56:52.075 --> 56:55.212
You almost blew us all up!

56:55.579 --> 57:00.050
Big deal! I went for his arm anyway.

57:04.655 --> 57:06.190
We made it...

57:07.624 --> 57:09.960
We beat the Osaka team.

57:30.447 --> 57:31.515
No...

57:32.583 --> 57:34.518
What the heck?

57:39.022 --> 57:40.157
Oh, God!

58:01.211 --> 58:02.212
Run.

58:07.684 --> 58:08.685
Run!

01:00:05.535 --> 01:00:06.770
We lost...

01:00:07.237 --> 01:00:08.639
Look at its head.

01:00:18.682 --> 01:00:20.684
-It's Oka.
-Oka?

01:00:21.518 --> 01:00:22.686
Hachiro Oka!

01:00:37.167 --> 01:00:38.435
He got it!

01:00:53.316 --> 01:00:54.551
Still bleeding.

01:00:55.552 --> 01:00:58.388
Hey, can you hear me?

01:01:00.791 --> 01:01:03.260
Kato, look at that!

01:01:06.630 --> 01:01:07.731
It's alive.

01:01:08.498 --> 01:01:09.433
Shit!

01:01:14.237 --> 01:01:15.205
Oka...

01:01:17.808 --> 01:01:21.745
So, if you live to the end of the game,
you'll recover?

01:01:21.812 --> 01:01:23.780
Well, yes...

01:01:25.415 --> 01:01:27.384
If Oka beats him quickly,

01:01:28.585 --> 01:01:29.920
it will help.

01:01:42.933 --> 01:01:44.601
It's too powerful!

01:01:45.602 --> 01:01:47.938
I don't even know how it attacked me.

01:01:50.006 --> 01:01:51.708
Oka can do it.

01:01:52.743 --> 01:01:54.444
He'll beat it!

01:01:55.378 --> 01:01:56.980
He's won seven times.

01:01:57.647 --> 01:01:58.882
<i>Hachiro Oka.</i>

01:02:17.968 --> 01:02:22.939
<i>You're deluded
<i>if you think you can beat me, sucker!</i></i>

01:02:32.549 --> 01:02:36.052
<i>What you don't know is,
<i>I played Ping-Pong in college!</i></i>

01:02:44.494 --> 01:02:46.596
<i>I also took karate lessons...</i>

01:02:47.497 --> 01:02:49.466
<i>by correspondence!</i>

01:03:12.489 --> 01:03:13.790
Amazing.

01:03:14.925 --> 01:03:16.626
Did he win...?

01:03:17.994 --> 01:03:19.596
<i>You want to die?</i>

01:03:21.631 --> 01:03:24.568
<i>It's not over. Can't you see?</i>

01:03:33.510 --> 01:03:36.880
I find this fascinating.

01:03:37.948 --> 01:03:40.050
Very fascinating.

01:03:51.061 --> 01:03:53.129
I think I got it.

01:04:03.773 --> 01:04:06.810
I've got it. Here I go!

01:04:29.532 --> 01:04:31.434
He'll lose...

01:04:32.602 --> 01:04:34.404
Come on, boy!

01:04:53.089 --> 01:04:54.491
Oka, no!

01:05:18.148 --> 01:05:19.716
Eat this!

01:05:36.666 --> 01:05:39.536
Only intuitive attacks work on him.

01:05:47.911 --> 01:05:50.246
Is it over? Did he die?

01:05:51.214 --> 01:05:52.148
Not yet.

01:05:52.582 --> 01:05:54.884
-No?
-What do you mean?

01:05:55.652 --> 01:05:58.688
Only surprise attacks work. I'll go cloak.

01:05:58.755 --> 01:06:01.658
You should finish him off now!

01:06:02.892 --> 01:06:04.260
No, it's risky.

01:06:09.833 --> 01:06:10.834
Damn it...

01:06:18.141 --> 01:06:19.242
It is risky.

01:06:20.510 --> 01:06:21.678
I know.

01:06:22.545 --> 01:06:23.713
But...

01:06:25.048 --> 01:06:26.683
someone's got to do it.

01:06:29.052 --> 01:06:30.086
Kato!

01:07:01.985 --> 01:07:03.053
Kato!

01:07:10.593 --> 01:07:13.063
Suzuki! Why did you...?

01:07:14.697 --> 01:07:16.132
Your brother...

01:07:17.600 --> 01:07:19.769
He's waiting for you.

01:07:23.039 --> 01:07:25.341
Suzuki! Suzuki!

01:07:53.603 --> 01:07:54.704
Reika.

01:07:56.039 --> 01:07:57.740
Watch Suzuki.

01:07:59.008 --> 01:08:00.009
But it's...

01:08:00.810 --> 01:08:01.678
too late.

01:08:04.013 --> 01:08:05.148
We can save him.

01:08:11.287 --> 01:08:12.689
What about you?

01:08:13.256 --> 01:08:14.357
I'll do it.

01:08:17.127 --> 01:08:18.261
I'll finish the game.

01:08:20.230 --> 01:08:22.165
-Kato!
-Don't!

01:08:28.938 --> 01:08:31.374
Where's that other guy?

01:08:32.175 --> 01:08:34.144
He was fun to play with.

01:09:03.840 --> 01:09:07.744
Stay here. I'll kill you later.

01:09:12.682 --> 01:09:15.318
Hey, are you okay?

01:09:17.287 --> 01:09:22.392
-What now?
-We can run and leave it to Oka!

01:09:22.926 --> 01:09:24.327
And if he loses?

01:09:24.394 --> 01:09:26.029
But...

01:09:26.095 --> 01:09:29.265
We have to think of a way to win!

01:09:29.866 --> 01:09:31.367
It's impossible.

01:09:32.168 --> 01:09:35.972
We can't die.
We both have someone waiting for us.

01:09:40.376 --> 01:09:42.145
That's why I'm going.

01:09:44.480 --> 01:09:45.882
I have to!

01:09:47.417 --> 01:09:50.386
<i>I have to! Who else will?</i>

01:09:52.789 --> 01:09:54.090
You're right.

01:09:55.491 --> 01:09:56.859
We have to.

01:09:57.894 --> 01:09:58.761
Reika.

01:09:58.828 --> 01:10:01.297
How can we beat that thing?

01:10:03.333 --> 01:10:06.436
Oka said it must be a surprise attack.

01:10:07.070 --> 01:10:09.172
How do we surprise him?

01:10:10.106 --> 01:10:11.474
Maybe we can snipe him.

01:10:15.979 --> 01:10:17.080
Good idea.

01:10:18.047 --> 01:10:22.452
I'll be a decoy. When he approaches,
shoot him from a distance.

01:10:22.919 --> 01:10:25.188
Are you out of your mind?!

01:10:29.492 --> 01:10:31.394
We have no choice.

01:10:35.198 --> 01:10:38.801
Are you sure we want to snipe him?

01:11:12.802 --> 01:11:14.070
Ayumu.

01:11:20.510 --> 01:11:21.511
What's wrong?

01:11:24.447 --> 01:11:25.882
Listen.

01:11:27.116 --> 01:11:29.919
I have to say this before I go.

01:11:32.055 --> 01:11:33.222
You...

01:11:34.957 --> 01:11:37.994
You mean a lot to me.

01:11:43.366 --> 01:11:44.600
Please don't die.

01:11:47.036 --> 01:11:48.905
Do not die, okay?

01:11:51.507 --> 01:11:53.076
I don't intend to.

01:11:56.946 --> 01:11:58.147
You mean it?

01:11:59.215 --> 01:12:01.017
You really mean it?

01:12:02.118 --> 01:12:03.119
Yes.

01:12:05.221 --> 01:12:09.158
I won't give up,
even if the odds are against me.

01:12:14.897 --> 01:12:16.366
Promise me.

01:12:17.633 --> 01:12:21.070
If you survive,
the four of us can live together.

01:12:22.171 --> 01:12:25.408
You, your brother, me, and my boy.

01:12:26.976 --> 01:12:30.546
All right? Make a promise.

01:12:36.486 --> 01:12:37.620
Come on!

01:12:39.088 --> 01:12:42.892
Just say "yes" when you're asked that.

01:12:48.398 --> 01:12:49.432
Yes.

01:12:52.168 --> 01:12:53.403
It's a promise.

01:12:56.072 --> 01:12:57.507
Don't break it!

01:13:03.546 --> 01:13:04.647
I'll protect you.

01:13:06.282 --> 01:13:07.483
I won't let you die!

01:13:09.152 --> 01:13:12.488
Watch me get a bull's-eye on that thing!

01:13:21.164 --> 01:13:24.033
I will make it home.

01:13:27.503 --> 01:13:28.638
For sure.

01:13:36.446 --> 01:13:37.647
What the...?

01:14:13.249 --> 01:14:16.018
<i>They're not in position yet...</i>

01:14:29.131 --> 01:14:30.166
Wait.

01:14:33.569 --> 01:14:35.004
Let me ask you.

01:14:36.472 --> 01:14:39.041
Why are we...

01:14:40.009 --> 01:14:41.744
killing each other?

01:14:44.313 --> 01:14:48.251
Do you feel that you're in God's presence?

01:14:49.151 --> 01:14:50.086
God?

01:14:51.254 --> 01:14:55.391
God is the absolute power.

01:14:58.060 --> 01:14:59.529
You're God...

01:15:00.630 --> 01:15:02.331
are you?

01:15:02.798 --> 01:15:08.070
This world has many.
I'm merely one of them.

01:15:08.738 --> 01:15:12.675
There is no defying that fact.

01:15:19.549 --> 01:15:21.050
I hit him!

01:15:30.626 --> 01:15:32.161
We'll live together!

01:15:33.262 --> 01:15:34.730
I'll end this!

01:15:36.265 --> 01:15:37.333
Die!

01:15:45.341 --> 01:15:46.609
I got it.

01:15:47.410 --> 01:15:48.444
I see.

01:15:51.547 --> 01:15:53.749
I can finish him off!

01:16:01.157 --> 01:16:03.092
He's just shooting blind.

01:16:57.680 --> 01:16:58.814
Kato!

01:18:43.285 --> 01:18:45.321
I got the Big Boss.

01:20:47.676 --> 01:20:48.844
It's over.

01:20:50.880 --> 01:20:52.748
It's really over.

01:22:26.709 --> 01:22:27.843
But I...

01:22:29.712 --> 01:22:31.780
I was of no help.

01:22:32.748 --> 01:22:33.983
Me neither.

01:22:34.750 --> 01:22:36.652
Kato did everything.

01:22:38.821 --> 01:22:39.922
Where is he?

01:22:41.056 --> 01:22:42.024
Oh, no!

01:22:43.859 --> 01:22:45.060
I guess he's dead.

01:22:47.029 --> 01:22:48.597
No...

01:22:49.698 --> 01:22:51.033
He did so much...

01:22:51.734 --> 01:22:52.901
Gantz.

01:22:53.902 --> 01:22:55.637
Score me.

01:23:03.512 --> 01:23:05.014
<i>Live from Osaka.</i>

01:23:05.914 --> 01:23:09.852
<i>With no explosions,
<i>the Dotonbori area is very quiet.</i></i>

01:23:09.918 --> 01:23:10.953
EAT BY YOURSELF.

01:23:12.287 --> 01:23:14.990
<i>There's no sign of the creatures.</i>

01:23:16.025 --> 01:23:19.862
<i>Soldiers are assessing the situation.</i>

01:23:22.664 --> 01:23:25.034
We only returned because of Kato...

01:23:52.628 --> 01:23:53.662
Kato!

01:23:56.198 --> 01:23:57.566
I...

01:23:58.734 --> 01:24:00.035
You survived.

01:24:00.903 --> 01:24:01.770
Oh, God!

01:24:02.638 --> 01:24:04.273
I'm so happy.

01:24:05.707 --> 01:24:07.176
You barely made it.

01:24:15.851 --> 01:24:18.654
<i>It's time to score your points.</i>

01:24:28.931 --> 01:24:30.666
<i>Jugs, six points.</i>

01:24:34.203 --> 01:24:35.971
<i>Baldy, two points.</i>

01:24:39.775 --> 01:24:41.777
<i>Nishi, 12 points.</i>

01:24:44.746 --> 01:24:47.716
It's your turn, Kato.

01:24:52.688 --> 01:24:55.858
<i>Kato-cha, LOL, 100 points.</i>

01:24:56.391 --> 01:24:58.160
-Shit!
-Amazing!

01:24:58.227 --> 01:24:59.862
You cleared it!

01:25:00.796 --> 01:25:02.097
Did I...?

01:25:05.234 --> 01:25:07.069
<i>Bonus menu.</i>

01:25:07.136 --> 01:25:11.306
<i>One, weapon.
<i>Two, resurrection. Three, freedom.</i></i>

01:25:24.219 --> 01:25:27.256
2. RESURRECT A DEAD PLAYER.

01:25:27.322 --> 01:25:29.391
3. HAVE YOUR MEMORY WIPED AND QUIT.

01:25:29.658 --> 01:25:31.226
Choose three and you're free.

01:25:31.994 --> 01:25:35.731
And go back to living
with your brother like before.

01:25:36.431 --> 01:25:37.432
I'm happy for you.

01:25:39.401 --> 01:25:40.435
Kato.

01:25:41.670 --> 01:25:42.704
Thank you.

01:25:43.372 --> 01:25:44.740
Goodbye.

01:25:45.274 --> 01:25:46.341
Have a nice life.

01:26:22.044 --> 01:26:23.011
Hey...?

01:26:27.049 --> 01:26:28.483
I didn't die...

01:26:39.995 --> 01:26:41.296
Oh, that fool...

01:26:44.032 --> 01:26:46.401
That hypocrite!

01:26:51.940 --> 01:26:55.944
KATO-CHA (LOL) 100 POINTS

01:27:11.927 --> 01:27:14.863
You think she was resurrected?

01:27:16.131 --> 01:27:18.200
But why, Kato?

01:27:18.834 --> 01:27:21.169
What about your brother?

01:27:22.104 --> 01:27:24.539
You'll have to join the game again.

01:27:25.240 --> 01:27:27.009
You could die.

01:27:28.010 --> 01:27:31.013
But I made her a promise.

01:27:37.919 --> 01:27:39.288
That's lame.

01:27:45.160 --> 01:27:46.495
I can leave?

01:27:52.100 --> 01:27:55.137
My brother's waiting at home!

01:28:10.585 --> 01:28:12.354
<i>You didn't tell Kato</i>

01:28:13.322 --> 01:28:16.191
<i>that he used to fight with us.</i>

01:28:16.558 --> 01:28:18.160
Your brother's waiting.

01:28:20.395 --> 01:28:21.596
Choose three.

01:28:25.133 --> 01:28:26.101
Kei...

01:28:32.140 --> 01:28:37.913
<i>If I had, he'd fight to resurrect
<i>everyone who'd ever died in the game.</i></i>

01:28:39.114 --> 01:28:40.349
<i>You're right.</i>

01:28:46.855 --> 01:28:49.858
I choose three. Free me.

01:28:57.632 --> 01:29:01.136
<i>I never thought he'd be back!</i>

01:29:03.372 --> 01:29:05.540
<i>He hasn't changed a bit.</i>

01:29:08.210 --> 01:29:11.179
<i>Every time it's the same for him.</i>

01:29:12.147 --> 01:29:15.484
<i>He risks his life for others.</i>

01:29:17.619 --> 01:29:20.322
Kurono was like that, too.

01:29:25.260 --> 01:29:26.628
I'll do the same.

01:29:29.931 --> 01:29:30.899
One day...

01:29:32.334 --> 01:29:34.169
I'll get Kurono back.

01:29:49.951 --> 01:29:50.952
I'm home!

01:35:09.571 --> 01:35:11.573
Subtitle translation by
Dean Shimauchi
